  "body": "Space, Style, Flexibility\r\n\r\nSet in a sought-after pocket of Millwater, 32 Grut Greens is an impressive statement of modern family living. Spanning an expansive 357sqm (more or less), this beautifully presented residence combines generous living spaces, quality finishes and exceptional flexibility, creating a home that effortlessly caters to growing families, extended households and those who simply appreciate having room to enjoy life.\r\n\r\nRecently refreshed to enhance its contemporary appeal, the property features a complete exterior repaint, brand-new flooring and upgraded cabinetry. With the added reassurance of the remaining Master Build Warranty, you can move in and enjoy everything this exceptional home has to offer.\r\n\r\nA Home Designed Around Your Lifestyle\r\n• Six Generously Sized Bedrooms: Plenty of accommodation for the entire family, with flexibility for guests, teenagers or working from home.\r\n\r\n• Four Well-Appointed Bathrooms: Thoughtfully positioned to provide everyday convenience and comfort.\r\n\r\n• Three Separate Living Areas: Multiple spaces to relax, entertain or enjoy a little privacy when needed.\r\n\r\n• A Kitchen Worth Gathering Around: The stylish kitchen is equipped with quality Bosch appliances, complemented by a spacious walk-in scullery. Its open-plan connection to the dining and living areas creates the perfect setting for family gatherings and entertaining.\r\n\r\n• A Private Master Haven: Unwind in the spacious master bedroom, featuring direct deck access, a generous walk-in wardrobe and an elegantly appointed ensuite.\r\n\r\n• Independent Living Potential: The lower level offers an external entrance, additional living space and separate accommodation, making it ideal for extended family, independent teenagers, visiting guests or a home-based business.\r\n\r\n• Year-Round Comfort: Ducted air conditioning provides a comfortable indoor environment throughout the seasons.\r\n\r\n\r\nParking, Privacy & Outdoor Enjoyment\r\nPracticality is just as impressive, with a double internal-access garage and additional off-street parking providing ample room for extra vehicles, a boat or campervan. Outside, established gardens and mature hedging create a welcoming sense of privacy while keeping maintenance to a minimum.\r\n\r\nAn Enviable Millwater Lifestyle\r\nEnjoy the convenience of being close to everything the Hibiscus Coast has to offer. Millwater and Silverdale shopping centres, popular cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities are all within easy reach. With convenient motorway connections for commuting to Auckland, plus zoning for Silverdale School and Orewa College, this address offers an excellent balance of lifestyle and location.\r\n\r\nBig on Space. Exceptional on Flexibility. Ready for Your Next Chapter.\r\n\r\nHomes offering this level of space, versatility and modern comfort are increasingly hard to find. Whether you have a large family, need accommodation for multiple generations or simply want a home with room to grow, 32 Grut Greens deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nGet in touch today to arrange your private viewing and discover everything this outstanding Millwater home has to offer.",
